o hire middle managers.**\n   - This option also focuses on the HRM department's role in hiring middle managers but does not address the company's development strategy. It does not weaken the argument about the department's role in decision-making.\n\nAfter evaluating each option, the one that most effectively weakens the argument is Option C, as it provides a counterexample showing that the HRM department can have a more significant role in the company's strategy.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>",
