en that K is the fourth dish, this creates a contradiction because K cannot be the first dish. Therefore, this option is not possible.\n\n### Conclusion:\nThe only option that satisfies all the given conditions is Option C: The fifth dish is L.\n\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>\n</think>",
