o the meaning of the given statement is:\n\\[ \\text{B) Truth can not be shut out unless all the doors of wrong are closed.} \\]\n\nThis option correctly captures the conditional relationship implied by the original statement.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>",
